<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-022" chapter-id="c-liangshu-022-wangchong-ancheng" source-id="s-liangshu-022-wangchong-ancheng-ws1513347">
  <p id="c-liangshu-022-wangchong-ancheng:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-022-wangchong-ancheng:p001:m0000" ref="z8c_kq5_fri">秀</persName>稱心受之，亦弗辭多也。昆弟之睦，時議歸之。故吏<persName id="c-liangshu-022-wangchong-ancheng:p001:m0024" ref="fko_55z_or0">夏侯稟</persName>等表立墓碑，詔許焉。當世高才游王門者，東海<persName id="c-liangshu-022-wangchong-ancheng:p001:m0048" ref="59d_72d_924_AAA">王僧孺</persName>、吳郡<persName id="c-liangshu-022-wangchong-ancheng:p001:m0054" ref="war_qdw_fs5">陸倕</persName>、彭城<persName id="c-liangshu-022-wangchong-ancheng:p001:m0059" ref="di1_zqb_t0f">劉孝綽</persName>、河東<persName id="c-liangshu-022-wangchong-ancheng:p001:m0065" ref="vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA">裴子野</persName>，各制其文，古未之有也。世子<persName id="c-liangshu-022-wangchong-ancheng:p001:m0082" ref="z8c_kq5_fri_A">機</persName>嗣。</p>
</text>
